 2 │ 
 3 │ Referentiable plan for the purpose/stressor dual-ring redesign on `view-landscape`
 4 │ (baseline `a6bb1fc`). Implement without subagents; red contracts live in:
 5 │ 
 6 │ - `web/src/landscape-triangular-lattice.test.ts` (dual-ring describes)
