10 │ ## Status
11 │ 
12 │ Implemented (lattice + geometry + hypergraph wiring + `web/generated/app.js`).
13 │ 
14 │ ### Follow-ups (2026-09-26)
15 │ 
16 │ - Nodes and lattice share `axialToDualRingPixel` (fixes lattice/purpose misalignment).
17 │ - Components pack onto component-band axial rings only; stressors on `stressorRingAxial` beyond the outer annulus.
18 │ - Long-arc also when a chord enters the correct annulus twice.
19 │ - Components pressure-free (`REGIONS_COMPONENT_CHARGE = 0`).
20 │ - Idle (no-selection) bundle opacity = 50% of lit (`REGIONS_BUNDLE_IDLE_OPACITY`).
21 │ - Hull mask halves opacity through the component band.
22 │ - Dashed borders on both edges of the inner annulus.
23 │ 
24 │ ## Radial stack (center → out)
25 │ 
26 │ 1. **Purpose ring** — mini-pyramids, apex inward, base facing components
27 │ 2. **Inner annulus**
28 │ 3. **Component band** — fixed **3-hop** thickness; grow only if components won’t fit or outer ring needs room
29 │ 4. **Outer annulus** — minimize
30 │ 5. **Stressor ring** — mini-pyramids, apex outward, base facing components
31 │ 
32 │ ## Per attractor
33 │ 
34 │ - Split into purpose + stressor mini-pyramids (same color)
35 │ - One convex hull over all forces; paint **below** components
36 │ - No per-subshape hulls
37 │ - Shared center ray through both tops (virtual OK); snap each top to nearest / ≤1 lattice step off
38 │ - Gap **0** between neighbors on a ring
39 │ - Missing purpose → **2-wide** empty placeholder on purpose ring; missing stressor → same on stressor ring
40 │ 
41 │ ## Mini-pyramid growth (`miniPyramidLayersForCount`)
42 │ 
43 │ Tall-before-wide / minimal base:
44 │ 
45 │ `1 → 2 → 2:1 → 3:1 → 3:2 → 3:2:1 → 4:2:1 → 4:3:1 → 4:3:2 → 4:3:2:1 → …`
46 │ 
47 │ Complete when layers equal `[h, h-1, …, 1]`. Otherwise fill lowest underfull row (`base - i`); if all full and not complete, push apex `1`; if complete, expand base.
48 │ 
49 │ Subshapes = **one per layer** (never triangles). Assign forces to layers by similarity.
50 │ 
51 │ ## Components
52 │ 
53 │ - Seed on **dominant attractor** ray, middle of 3-hop band (2nd from outer edge)
54 │ - Component charge/collision at **25%** of prior (`-1400` → `-350`)
55 │ - Force→component link / attractor pressures also **25%**
56 │ 
57 │ ## Bundling
58 │ 
59 │ - Purpose: `component → inner-annulus mid → layer approach → force`
60 │ - Stressor: `component → outer-annulus mid → layer approach → force`
61 │ - **Long arc** iff a more direct route would enter the **wrong** annulus
62 │ - Long arc: depart along tangent to correct annulus **±10°** (CW/CCW), enter that annulus, spiral, then split
63 │ - Short hops: near-radial into the correct mid
